  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Duane Robert Donaldson, known as Bob, is an American construction businessman and chairman of the Donaldson Organization. He expanded the New York contracting business established by his grandfather and bought his brother’s interests. A business graduate of Long Island University, he later shared leadership of the group with his son Douglas.",
    "html": "<p>Duane Robert Donaldson, known as Bob, is an American construction businessman and chairman of the Donaldson Organization. He expanded the New York contracting business established by his grandfather and bought his brother’s interests. A business graduate of Long Island University, he later shared leadership of the group with his son Douglas.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 51,
